  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4857918aa396e664da4bf6e1e0405844, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level1(1-C)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - "That\u2019s fascinating! Do you have any other inspirations or influences in
    your work? Something that makes your style unique?"
  - "Ah, well\u2026\r\nMy heritage has always been a source of inspiration. "
  - "My family is Japanese, you see, and I grew up surrounded by the beauty of traditional
    craftsmanship\u2014\r\ndelicate ceramics, intricate woodwork, and, of course,
    the elegance of nature."
  - "The wisteria tree, for instance, holds a special place in Japanese culture.
    \r\nIts cascading blooms symbolize love, perseverance, and the fleeting nature
    of beauty."
  - "I\u2019ve always tried to infuse that sense of grace and meaning into my work.
    It\u2019s what sets my pieces apart, I think. A touch of the East blended with
    the innovation of the West.\r\n"
  responses:
  - responseText: Fun? Hobbies?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6af862d413faedc4f8e88a0dbbf4ba24, type: 2}
  - responseText: Culutre?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3eaae63968abe0469e71a0cb06eca11, type: 2}
